<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="muted">Last updated <?= date('F j, Y') ?></p>
<h2>What we collect</h2><p>Your account details (name, email, username, password hash), the profile information you choose to add (photo, bio, budget, move-in date, lifestyle preferences, preferred properties), the content you post, your messages, and basic technical data such as IP address for security and abuse prevention.</p>
<h2>How we use it</h2><p>To run the Service: show your profile to other members, calculate roommate compatibility, deliver messages and notifications, keep the community safe, and contact you about your account.</p>
<h2>Who can see what</h2><p>Your profile is visible to logged-in members unless you hide it in Settings. Your email address is never shown to other members. Messages are visible only to you, the other person, and administrators when investigating a report.</p>
<h2>We don’t sell your data</h2><p>We don’t sell personal information. Rise Apartments may use aggregated, non-identifying statistics (for example, how many renters are interested in a property).</p>
<h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can edit your profile, hide it from search, or permanently delete your account in Settings. Deleting your account removes your profile, posts, comments and messages.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions? Contact Rise Apartments through <a href="https://riseapartments.com">riseapartments.com</a>.</p>
</article>
